{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 23, :comments ["<b>Truth</b> — The word is deficient; it should be ספרי אמת, [i.e.] the letters of אמת — acquire and do not sell."], :book :proverbs, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 23, :notes {0 "Resolved 'ספרי' as 'letters of' based on the standard deficient-spelling argument (אמת lacking vav); an alternative reading 'ספרי' as 'my sages' is possible but less likely given the context."}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Proverbs -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/mishley/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:24:21.977422650Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}